# Per-machine settings for the Makefile. Copy to Makefile.local and edit.
# Makefile.local is gitignored: each machine keeps its own.
#
#     cp Makefile.local.example Makefile.local
#
# BENCH = $(HOME)/autoerp-bench
# SITE  = autoerp.localhost
#
# These drive a bench that ALREADY EXISTS. Creating one is a separate job —
# see docs/instalasi.md. And this is for development only: `make up` runs
# `bench start`, which dies with the terminal and is not restarted on boot or
# after a crash. A server runs `bench setup production` (supervisor + nginx)
# instead.
